/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 486 0 R
/T (The Manufacturing Defect Intelligence project demonstrates the application of machine learning to classify manufacturing defects into Critical, Minor, and Moderate severity levels. The Tuned Support Vector Machine achieved the highest cross-validation Macro F1-score of 37.10%, while Tuned K-Nearest Neighbors recorded the highest test Macro F1-score of 33.54%. However, the results revealed limited predictive performance, weak generalization, and significant challenges in identifying Critical defects.)
/E (The Manufacturing Defect Intelligence project demonstrates the application of machine learning to classify manufacturing defects into Critical, Minor, and Moderate severity levels. The Tuned Support Vector Machine achieved the highest cross-validation Macro F1-score of 37.10%, while Tuned K-Nearest Neighbors recorded the highest test Macro F1-score of 33.54%. However, the results revealed limited predictive performance, weak generalization, and significant challenges in identifying Critical defects.)
/Pg 102 0 R
/K [0]
>>
