/Title (The combination of exploratory analysis, feature engineering, model comparison, error analysis, and explainability provides a broader understanding of the dataset's predictive limitations and the factors influencing model behavior. The project therefore demonstrates not only a comprehensive multiclass classification workflow, but also the importance of informative manufacturing data, reliable validation, and risk-aware model evaluation in developing practical quality assurance solutions.)
